---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  locale="en"
  title="Privacy"
  description="How Sabrina The RMT handles website privacy, email, Jane booking links and optional Google Maps."
  path="/privacy/"
>
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="shell content-narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy notice</p>
      <h1>A simple, privacy-conscious website</h1>
      <p class="page-lede">
        This website is designed to collect as little information as possible.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section section-white">
    <div class="shell content-narrow prose">
      <h2>Information collected on this website</h2>
      <p>
        This website does not include a contact form, online intake form, newsletter or advertising
        pixels. It does not ask you to submit personal health information. As with most websites,
        the hosting and network providers may process basic technical logs needed to deliver and
        protect the site, such as an IP address, request time, page requested and browser
        information.
      </p>

      <h2>Website statistics</h2>
      <p>
        We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand visits, page views, referral sources and page
        performance. It does not use analytics cookies or track individual visitors across websites.
        Your browser sends page and technical performance information to Cloudflare. We also use
        Google Search Console to understand how this website appears in Google Search. These tools
        do not give us appointment details or health-history information from Jane. Learn more about <a
          href="https://www.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/">Cloudflare Web Analytics</a
        >.
      </p>

      <h2>Booking through Jane</h2>
      <p>
        Booking buttons take you to Sabrina’s Jane booking site. Jane is a separate service with its
        own privacy practices. Appointment and health-history information should be entered only
        through Jane, not through this website or ordinary email.
      </p>

      <h2>Email and telephone</h2>
      <p>
        You may call <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a> or email <a
          href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a
        > for general questions. By-request appointments can be requested by email. Ordinary email and
        voicemail are not intended for personal health information, so please do not include health details
        in a message.
      </p>

      <h2>Google Maps</h2>
      <p>
        The location maps are not loaded automatically. If you choose “Show map,” your browser
        connects to Google and Google may receive technical information about your visit. You can
        use the written addresses without loading a map.
      </p>

      <h2>Questions and accessible information</h2>
      <p>
        For a privacy question or to request this information in an accessible format, call <a
          href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a
        > or email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> without including personal health
        information in email or voicemail.
      </p>
      <p><em>Last updated: September 6, 2026.</em></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
